## Open Threads

- Exact Walrus testnet storage node count and operator identities — not publicly enumerated; testnet is permissioned
- Walrus testnet blob count, storage volume, bandwidth metrics — no public dashboard or transparency report
- WAL token TGE date, initial circulating supply, launch mechanism (auction, LBP, public sale, airdrop) — no official announcement
- Walrus mainnet launch date — not announced; dependent on testnet hardening and Sui governance
- Wormhole integration technical specs, launch timeline, and whether WAL token needed for cross-chain fees — only announcement, no docs
- Walrus Foundation legal formation, jurisdiction, initial treasury allocation — announced as planned, no public filing
- FTX Ventures equity status in Mysten Labs post-bankruptcy — conflicting reports, no official settlement disclosure
- Sui Foundation grant recipients specifically building on Walrus — no public dashboard filtering for Walrus-specific grants
- Competitor benchmark: Walrus vs Filecoin/Arweave/0G on cost-per-GB, retrieval latency, durability guarantees — no independent third-party benchmarks published
- Walrus Sites custom domain support (non-SNS) status and timeline — docs mention planned, no details
- Audit reports for Walrus core protocol, Seal threshold encryption, Wormhole bridge contracts — not publicly released
- Market size addressable: Developer demand for programmable storage on Sui vs general-purpose storage — no TAM/SAM analysis published
- Whether Walrus will have native token incentives for storage nodes at mainnet launch (WAL staking, slashing) — tokenomics doc references but no final params
- Exchange listing discussions / market maker arrangements for WAL — no public info